rsepuh is MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

rsepuh does not bundle third-party programs. It downloads and runs them on the remote sandbox:
- EffectCraft (https://github.com/storytold/effectcraft), MIT OR Apache-2.0, installed from its GitHub
  release with the published SHA-256 checksum verified.
- Blender (https://www.blender.org), GPL, installed by rblender from download.blender.org.
- edge-tts (https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts), run through `uv` for the optional free voice. It uses
  Microsoft's online read-aloud service; check its terms for your use.
- Google Gemini API, optional, with your own key.

Bundled fonts used by the default themes (Inter, JetBrains Mono) ship inside EffectCraft under their own open licences.
